diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 0cd6db5..bc55b15 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,4 +1,13 @@
-An HTTP server that routes each request by the method and target in its request line.
+An HTTP server that reads the request line, headers, and any Content-Length body
+before routing. `/echo` accepts any method and returns plain text containing the
+method and path (for example, `POST /echo`). Malformed or incomplete requests
+receive `400 Bad Request`.
+
+Requests use HTTP/1.0 or HTTP/1.1 and CRLF line endings. Transfer-Encoding is
+unsupported. Headers are limited to 64 KiB and bodies to 1 MiB. The request line
+limit defaults to 8192 bytes and can be set with `MAX_REQUEST_LINE_BYTES`.
+
+Run tests: `npm test`
 
 Run: `node server.js`
 
